            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.27</h2>
<ul>
<li>Every meeting action point that is yours now lands in your to-do list — none get merged away or hidden as a suggestion.</li>
<li>Clicking Jarvis in the Dock after a meeting opens the window again, instead of doing nothing until you restart the app.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
